# SHA-256 of each archive of the Dolt release in version.Dolt, named by
# its path under https://github.com/dolthub/dolt/releases/download/.
# scripts/install-dolt.sh takes the release from this file and verifies
# what it downloads against it; a test keeps the release equal to
# version.Dolt and the Linux checksums equal to those CI and the Docker
# test server verify. RELEASING.md says how to change the pin.
